---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Read the WasmStore terms for using the browser-game directory, external demos, project links, intellectual property, acceptable use, and limitations." path="/terms">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">PIXEL ARCADE · SITE RULES</div><h1>TERMS OF <span class="gradient-text">SERVICE</span></h1><p>Last updated: October 17, 2026 · The basics of using this directory responsibly.</p></div></section>
  <article class="prose wrap legal-page">
    <p class="legal-kicker">USER TERMS / PLEASE READ</p>
    <p>These Terms of Service apply to your use of the WasmStore website and its game-discovery directory. By accessing the site, you agree to use it lawfully and responsibly. If you do not agree with these terms, please stop using the site. These terms are general website information and are not legal advice; mandatory rights provided by applicable law remain unaffected.</p>
    <h2>1. What WasmStore provides</h2><p>WasmStore organizes descriptive information and links related to browser-playable games, community projects, demos, source repositories, and gaming resources. It is a discovery directory, not a guarantee that every listed game is hosted by us, available at all times, or compatible with your device.</p>
    <h2>2. Third-party games and services</h2><p>Games and links may be hosted or maintained by independent developers, publishers, communities, repository platforms, or other providers. Those services can change, move, become unavailable, require additional software, or impose their own terms. Your use of a third-party service is governed by its applicable terms, privacy notice, age rating, and license. WasmStore does not control external services and cannot guarantee their safety, uptime, accuracy, or behavior.</p>
    <h2>3. Intellectual property and licenses</h2><p>Game titles, trademarks, logos, characters, artwork, music, code, and other creative material belong to their respective owners or licensors. A link or listing does not transfer ownership or grant permission to download, copy, modify, stream, host, or redistribute any material. You are responsible for checking and following the relevant license and obtaining any permission required for your intended use.</p>
    <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2><p>You agree not to use the site to violate applicable law or third-party rights; attempt to disrupt, overload, or compromise the site; probe or bypass security controls without authorization; submit knowingly false reports; or misuse links and information in ways that harm others. Do not attempt to interfere with the site's normal operation or access systems you are not authorized to use.</p>
    <h2>5. Catalog accuracy and changes</h2><p>We aim to provide useful and understandable descriptions, but project details can become outdated. We do not warrant that every listing, control guide, source link, compatibility note, or availability statement is complete or current. We may correct, reorganize, restrict, or remove a listing or site feature when appropriate.</p>
    <h2>6. Favorites and browser-local features</h2><p>Some convenience features may store favorites or recent activity in your browser. These features can be affected by browser settings, private browsing, device changes, or clearing site data. We do not guarantee that local preferences will persist indefinitely or transfer between devices.</p>
    <h2>7. No professional advice or endorsement</h2><p>Directory entries are provided for general discovery and informational purposes. Inclusion is not a recommendation, certification, security audit, or endorsement of a game, developer, repository, or external provider. You should assess external projects and their licenses before use.</p>
    <h2>8. Availability and warranties</h2><p>We aim to keep the directory accessible but do not promise uninterrupted or error-free service. To the extent permitted by applicable law, the site and its content are provided on an “as available” and “as is” basis, without warranties that cannot be established or are not implied by law.</p>
    <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2><p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, WasmStore is not responsible for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive losses arising from your use of the directory or third-party services. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability where that exclusion or limitation is prohibited by law.</p>
    <h2>10. External links and security</h2><p>External links are provided for convenience and discovery. Before downloading software, granting permissions, entering credentials, or sharing personal information with another service, review the destination carefully and use appropriate security practices. WasmStore cannot guarantee the content or security of a third-party destination.</p>
    <h2>11. Copyright reports</h2><p>If you believe a listing raises an intellectual-property concern, follow the steps in our <a href="/copyright">Copyright and Takedown Policy</a>. Reports should be accurate, specific, and submitted in good faith.</p>
    <h2>12. Privacy</h2><p>Your use of the site is also described in the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, including browser-local preferences, external links, and possible third-party services.</p>
    <h2>13. Changes to these terms</h2><p>We may revise these terms as the website and its features change. The date near the top identifies the latest material revision. Continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p>
    <h2>14. Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={'mailto:'+site.contactEmail}>{site.contactEmail}</a> or submitted through the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </article>
  <style>.legal-page{max-width:900px;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:64px;line-height:1.8}.legal-page .legal-kicker{font:700 11px/1.5 var(--font-pixel);letter-spacing:.08em;color:#6b55d8}.legal-page h2{font-family:var(--font-pixel);font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.4;margin-top:34px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);text-transform:uppercase}.legal-page p,.legal-page li{font-size:16px}.legal-page a{color:#5b43c6;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.legal-page a:hover{color:#d73569}@media(max-width:600px){.legal-page{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.legal-page p,.legal-page li{font-size:15px}.legal-page h2{font-size:17px}}</style>
</BaseLayout>